{
  "_about": "Places and peoples for ub-recall.js. `article` matches the names writers use (modern ones too: Maya, Aztec, Rapa Nui); `book` matches the names The Urantia Book uses for the same subject. Add a group when you write about a place or people not listed. The Urantia Book Network found the need on 2026-09-27: articles on the Maya passed every quote check, yet nobody had searched \"Central America\", and 64:7.5 and 79:5.8 name the founders of those civilizations. A group may set bookFlags and articleFlags (default \"i\").",
  "skipPapers": {
    "papers": [
      57,
      58,
      59,
      60,
      61
    ],
    "why": "Papers 57 to 61 are the planet's geology and pre-human life; their Mexico, Pacific or Europe mentions are land and sea ages before man. Take a paper off this list if an article writes about that geology."
  },
